---
import Tunnel from '../../../layouts/Tunnel.astro';
import Choice from '../../../components/Choice.astro';
// DRAFT - Antonio review pending
---
<Tunnel title="Survival Mode | Save My Gig!" status="Critical · Survival" red>
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Step 3 of 3</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">Survival mode: play without your USB</h2>

  <p class="dim">Stop troubleshooting. Just get sound out of the speakers when it is your turn.</p>

  <!-- "Play from your phone" was listed here as a peer of borrowing a drive.
       It is not one. It needs a USB-C to 3.5mm adapter and a 3.5mm to twin RCA
       cable that almost nobody has in the bag, and even working it is a room
       that is not silent rather than a DJ playing. Demoted to match the
       decision recorded in src/data/runlist.js. -->
  <ul class="checklist">
    <li><strong>Ask the DJ before or after you.</strong> Their drive is a rekordbox export like yours, so it will read. This has happened to all of them.</li>
    <li><strong>Check for a booth laptop.</strong> Your USB may still read on a computer even if players refuse it.</li>
    <li><strong>Swap slots</strong> with the next DJ and use the extra time.</li>
  </ul>

  <details class="move-more" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
    <summary>If there is no drive anywhere</summary>
    <p>
      A phone into a spare channel keeps the room from going silent. Be clear
      with yourself about what it is: not your set continuing, the night not
      stopping. It only works if you already carry a USB-C to 3.5mm adapter and
      a 3.5mm to twin RCA cable.
    </p>
  </details>

  <p class="question">Did you find a way to play?</p>

  <Choice step="survival"
    a={{ href: '/saved?path=critical&branch=survival', label: "YES, I AM COVERED", event: 'outcome_reached', data: { outcome: 'saved', path: 'critical' } }}
    b={{ href: '/files-lost?path=critical&branch=survival', label: 'NO, NOTHING WORKED', event: 'outcome_reached', data: { outcome: 'lost', path: 'critical' } }}
  />
</Tunnel>
